# PERMISSION-MODE-CASE: `/permissions full`, a word fx's parse refuses
# (`config_runtime.zig:3158@481104fd`). fx's composer completes it from the
# argument menu before Enter (to `full-access`); xfx has no argument
# completion (docs/parity.md, the `full-screen TUI` row), so its answer is
# the usage. Recorded, not GREEN.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 2
type /permissions full
wait 0.5
snap typed
key Enter
fx: until shown Full access
fx: until gone Full access
xfx: wait 1
snap full
home end
